,"byline":"Mel Kiper Jr.","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan WR Andrew Marsh facing misdemeanor indecent exposure charge","description":"Michigan receiver Andrew Marsh is facing a misdemeanor charge of indecent exposure stemming from a February incident involving a food service driver.","published":"2026-11-19T21:15:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50533990/michigan-wr-marsh-facing-misdemeanor-indecent-exposure-charge","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-19T21:22:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Hall of Famer Jack Ham returning to broadcast booth after health scare","description":"Hall of Fame linebacker and Penn State radio analyst Jack Ham will return to the broadcast booth on Saturday, just two weeks after suffering a medical emergency.","published":"2026-11-19T19:37:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532925/jack-ham-returning-broadcast-booth-health-scare","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 'College GameDay' Week 12: Virginia Tech vs. Miami","description":"\"College GameDay\" heads to University of Miami for Week 12.","published":"2026-11-19T19:27:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532540/2026-college-gameday-week-12-virginia-tech-vs-miami","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Studies: Blood test has potential to detect CTE in the living","description":"A new blood test shows potential to detect advanced stages of chronic traumatic encephalopathy (CTE) in the living, according to two recent published studies.","published":"2026-11-19T22:37:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50532686/studies-blood-test-potential-detect-cte-living","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Shwetha Surendran and Mark Fainaru-Wada","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What we learned about new NC State coach Philip Rivers in Fairhope, Alabama","description":"Rivers, the former NC State and NFL star quarterback, had been coaching high school football for six years.","published":"2026-11-19T12:19:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50514617/philip-rivers-nc-state-fairhope-alabama","type":"Story","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5138451/luke-reynolds","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luke_Reynolds_(American_football)"},"pick":{"pick":44,"round":2,"team":"ARI","via":"HOU","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Luke Reynolds (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luke_Reynolds_(American_football)","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-17T20:10:34Z","intro":"Luke Reynolds is an American college football tight end for the Virginia Tech Hokies. He previously played for the Penn State Nittany Lions.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Reynolds grew up in Westford, Massachusetts and originally attended Lawrence Academy in Groton, Massachusetts. He transferred to Cheshire Academy in Cheshire, Connecticut after his sophomore year. As a senior, he caught 48 passes for 754 yards and nine touchdowns. After the season Reynolds played in the 2024 All-American Bowl.\nReynolds was initially rated a three-star recruit and committed to play college football at Penn State. He was later reranked as a five-star recruit and the best tight end prospect in the 2024 class by 247Sports."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Reynolds joined the Penn State Nittany Lions as an early enrollee in January 2024. He entered his freshman season as a backup at tight end to Tyler Warren. Reynolds finished his first season with the team with nine receptions for 111 yards and one touchdown. He played in all 13 of the Nittany Lions' games as a sophomore and caught 26 passes for 257 yards. After the end of the season, Reynolds entered the NCAA transfer portal.\nReynolds transferred to Virginia Tech, reuniting him with former Penn State head coach James Franklin."}]}}